      "html": "<div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#f6f4ed] text-[#15251d] antialiased\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"page layout container\" style=\"font-family:'DM Sans', sans-serif\">\n    <style>\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500&display=swap');\n    @keyframes haze-drift { 0%,100% { transform: translate3d(0,0,0) scale(1); opacity:.65; } 50% { transform: translate3d(12px,-8px,0) scale(1.06); opacity:.85; } }\n    @keyframes quiet-float { 0%,100% { transform: translateY(0); } 50% { transform: translateY(-4px); } }\n    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { *,*::before,*::after { animation-duration:.01ms !important; animation-iteration-count:1 !important; scroll-behavior:auto !important; } }\n    </style>\n    <nav aria-label=\"Primary navigation\" class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 z-30\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"primary navigation header\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[1120px] items-center justify-between px-7 py-6 lg:px-0\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"navigation wrapper\">\n            <a aria-label=\"Collision home\" class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand link\" href=\"#top\">\n                <img alt=\"Collision helmet mark\" class=\"h-8 w-8 rounded-full object-cover ring-1 ring-white/30\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"collision logo image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/frontend-new/public/collision-helmet.png\"/>\n                <span class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"brand name text\">\n                    collision.\n                </span>\n            </a>\n            <div class=\"hidden items-center gap-9 text-[12px] font-medium tracking-[0.04em] text-white/80 md:flex\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"navigation links container\">\n                <a class=\"hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"approach navigation link\" href=\"#approach\">\n                    Approach\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"what we own navigation link\" href=\"#owns\">\n                    What we own\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"proof navigation link\" href=\"#proof\">\n                    Proof\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <a class=\"rounded-full bg-[#15251d] px-5 py-2.5 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#f6f4ed] ring-1 ring-white/30 hover:bg-[#243d30]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"hire collision call-to-action button\" href=\"#contact\">\n                Hire Collision\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n    <main data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"main content area\" id=\"top\">\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\" class=\"relative isolate flex min-h-[720px] items-center overflow-hidden bg-[#183b2d]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\" data-name=\"hero section\">\n            <video autoplay=\"\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"hero background video\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://images.pexels.com/videos/14017302/pexels-photo-14017302.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&fit=crop&h=630&w=1200\" preload=\"metadata\" src=\"https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/14017302/14017302-sd_960_540_30fps.mp4\">\n            </video>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#163c2d]/55\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"hero background overlay\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-2/3 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#112e24]/75 to-transparent\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"hero gradient shadow\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -right-20 top-28 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-[#f7d99b]/20 blur-3xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"decorative hazy orb\" style=\"animation:haze-drift 10s ease-in-out infinite\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[920px] flex-col items-center px-7 pb-8 pt-28 text-center text-white lg:px-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-5\" data-name=\"hero text content container\">\n                <p class=\"mb-6 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-white/75\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-5-1\" data-name=\"hero eyebrow text\">\n                    AI growth executive\n                </p>\n                <h1 class=\"max-w-[840px] font-[Lora] text-[48px] font-medium leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.06em] sm:text-[68px] lg:text-[82px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-5-2\" data-name=\"hero headline text\" id=\"hero-title\">\n                    Breathe. Your growth is\n                    <em class=\"font-normal text-[#f6d6a1]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-5-2-1\" data-name=\"highlighted headline text\">\n                        being handled.\n                    </em>\n                </h1>\n                <p class=\"mt-7 max-w-[590px] text-[16px] leading-7 text-white/82 sm:text-[18px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-5-3\" data-name=\"hero subheadline text\">\n                    Collision learns your business and quietly builds momentum across LinkedIn, X, SEO, AI search, newsletters, outbound, and everything in between.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"mt-10 w-full max-w-[760px] rounded-[20px] bg-[#fbfaf6] p-2.5 text-left text-[#15251d] ring-1 ring-white/40\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-5-4\" data-name=\"growth input command bar\" style=\"animation:quiet-float 8s ease-in-out infinite\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-center\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-5-4-1\" data-name=\"input bar inner container\">\n                        <div class=\"flex-1 px-4 py-4 text-[15px] text-[#7f847e]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-5-4-1-1\" data-name=\"command bar placeholder text\">\n                            What should we grow today?\n                        </div>\n                        <button class=\"rounded-[13px] bg-[#15251d] px-6 py-4 text-[13px] font-semibold text-white hover:bg-[#294737]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-5-4-1-2\" data-name=\"run growth submit button\">\n                            Run growth\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 border-t border-[#15251d]/10 px-3 pb-2 pt-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-5-4-2\" data-name=\"command suggestions container\">\n                        <span class=\"rounded-full bg-[#edf0e9] px-3.5 py-2 text-[11px] text-[#536259]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-5-4-2-1\" data-name=\"write linkedin posts suggestion\">\n                            Write LinkedIn posts\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"rounded-full bg-[#edf0e9] px-3.5 py-2 text-[11px] text-[#536259]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-5-4-2-2\" data-name=\"run seo suggestion\">\n                            Run SEO\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"rounded-full bg-[#edf0e9] px-3.5 py-2 text-[11px] text-[#536259]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-5-4-2-3\" data-name=\"find leads suggestion\">\n                            Find leads\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"rounded-full bg-[#edf0e9] px-3.5 py-2 text-[11px] text-[#536259]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-5-4-2-4\" data-name=\"optimize ai search suggestion\">\n                            Optimize us for AI search\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"mt-5 text-[11px] tracking-[0.08em] text-white/70\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-5-5\" data-name=\"command bar meta info\">\n                    Private memory\n                    <span class=\"mx-2 text-white/35\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-5-5-1\" data-name=\"first separator bullet\">\n                        •\n                    </span>\n                    approval-based\n                    <span class=\"mx-2 text-white/35\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-5-5-2\" data-name=\"second separator bullet\">\n                        •\n                    </span>\n                    always on\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-label=\"Growth channels\" class=\"border-b border-[#15251d]/10 bg-[#f6f4ed]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2\" data-name=\"growth channels section\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[1120px] flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-9 gap-y-4 px-7 py-5 text-[11px] font-medium tracking-[0.08em] text-[#657068] lg:justify-between lg:px-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"growth channels list container\">\n                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"linkedin channel link\">\n                    <i class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#2d6e51]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"linkedin channel bullet\">\n                    </i>\n                    LinkedIn\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"x channel link\">\n                    <i class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#d7836e]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"x channel bullet\">\n                    </i>\n                    X\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"seo channel link\">\n                    <i class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#5c8c6b]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"seo channel bullet\">\n                    </i>\n                    SEO\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"ai search channel link\">\n                    <i class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#d4a75c]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"ai search channel bullet\">\n                    </i>\n                    AI Search\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-5\" data-name=\"newsletters channel link\">\n                    <i class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7b9ab1]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-5-1\" data-name=\"newsletters channel bullet\">\n                    </i>\n                    Newsletters\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-6\" data-name=\"outbound channel link\">\n                    <i class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#345e4a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-6-1\" data-name=\"outbound channel bullet\">\n                    </i>\n                    Outbound\n                </span>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"philosophy-title\" class=\"bg-[#f6f4ed] px-7 py-28 lg:px-0 lg:py-36\" data-kid=\"1-2-3\" data-name=\"approach philosophy section\" id=\"approach\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1120px] gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.12fr_.88fr] lg:gap-28\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"philosophy content grid\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"philosophy left column\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-start gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"philosophy headline icon area\">\n                        <span class=\"mt-2 font-[Lora] text-[118px] leading-[.74] text-[#2d6e51]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"philosophy icon Y\">\n                            Y\n                        </span>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"philosophy header text container\">\n                            <p class=\"mb-7 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#7c877e]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"philosophy eyebrow text\">\n                                The quiet advantage\n                            </p>\n                            <h2 class=\"max-w-[690px] font-[Lora] text-[44px] font-medium leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.055em] text-[#183b2d] sm:text-[60px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"philosophy section headline\" id=\"philosophy-title\">\n                                Your brand compounds as you live.\n                            </h2>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"ml-[62px] mt-10 max-w-[600px] text-[18px] leading-8 text-[#536259]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"philosophy description text\">\n                        Collision remembers what matters: your point of view, your customers, your market, your standards. It turns that memory into a living growth engine that gets more useful every day—without asking you to coordinate a thing.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-end border-l border-[#15251d]/15 pl-8 lg:pl-12\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"philosophy quote section\">\n                    <p class=\"font-[Lora] text-[28px] leading-[1.25] tracking-[-0.04em] text-[#183b2d]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"philosophy pull quote\">\n                        “One conversation. One memory. One source of truth.”\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-10 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#7c877e]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"philosophy testimonial avatars\">\n                        <span class=\"grid h-7 w-7 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#2d6e51] text-[10px] font-semibold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"mc avatar icon\">\n                            MC\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"grid h-7 w-7 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#d7836e] text-[10px] font-semibold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"ar avatar icon\">\n                            AR\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"grid h-7 w-7 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#d2b36b] text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#183b2d]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"jp avatar icon\">\n                            JP\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"ml-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"testimonial caption\">\n                            Your team stays in the loop.\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"workflow-title\" class=\"bg-[#183b2d] px-7 py-24 text-[#f6f4ed] lg:px-0 lg:py-32\" data-kid=\"1-2-4\" data-name=\"workflow section\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1120px] gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[.85fr_1.15fr] lg:items-start lg:gap-28\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"workflow content grid\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"workflow text column\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#b8cfbc]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"workflow eyebrow text\">\n                        Behind the scenes\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-7 max-w-[430px] font-[Lora] text-[45px] font-medium leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.055em] sm:text-[58px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"workflow section headline\" id=\"workflow-title\">\n                        The calm behind the momentum.\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-7 max-w-[370px] text-[16px] leading-7 text-[#c1d1c3]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-3\" data-name=\"workflow description text\">\n                        You give Collision the destination. It handles the route with patience, context, and a bias toward useful work.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"border-y border-[#c9ddc7]/25 py-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"workflow timeline container\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#c9ddc7]/20 pb-5 text-[12px] text-[#b8cfbc]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"workflow status bar\">\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"workflow task name\">\n                            REQUEST / Launch our product\n                        </span>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"workflow task time\">\n                            09:41\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-start gap-5 border-b border-[#c9ddc7]/15 py-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"workflow step 1\">\n                        <span class=\"mt-1 text-[#91d7aa]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"workflow step checkmark\">\n                            ✓\n                        </span>\n                        <div class=\"flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"workflow step content\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"workflow step title\">\n                                Researching the market\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#a8bdae]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"workflow step description\">\n                                Audience, alternatives, language\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-[11px] text-[#a8bdae]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"workflow step time\">\n                            09:43\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-start gap-5 border-b border-[#c9ddc7]/15 py-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3\" data-name=\"workflow step 2\">\n                        <span class=\"mt-1 text-[#91d7aa]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"workflow step checkmark\">\n                            ✓\n                        </span>\n                        <div class=\"flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"workflow step content\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"workflow step title\">\n                                Shaping the point of view\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#a8bdae]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"workflow step description\">\n                                The idea worth remembering\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-[11px] text-[#a8bdae]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-3\" data-name=\"workflow step time\">\n                            09:51\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-start gap-5 border-b border-[#c9ddc7]/15 py-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-4\" data-name=\"workflow step 3\">\n                        <span class=\"mt-1 text-[#91d7aa]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"workflow step checkmark\">\n                            ✓\n                        </span>\n                        <div class=\"flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"workflow step content\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"workflow step title\">\n                                Drafting the campaign\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#a8bdae]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"workflow step description\">\n                                Posts, email, landing page\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-[11px] text-[#a8bdae]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-4-3\" data-name=\"workflow step time\">\n                            10:14\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-start gap-5 pt-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-5\" data-name=\"workflow step 4\">\n                        <span class=\"mt-1 text-[#e2a28e]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"workflow step arrow icon\">\n                            ↗\n                        </span>\n                        <div class=\"flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-5-2\" data-name=\"workflow step content\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[16px] text-[#f0c5b7]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"workflow step title\">\n                                Publishing and learning\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#a8bdae]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-5-2-2\" data-name=\"workflow step description\">\n                                Waiting for the first signal\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-[11px] text-[#a8bdae]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-5-3\" data-name=\"workflow step time\">\n                            now\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"ecosystem-title\" class=\"bg-[#f6f4ed] px-7 py-28 lg:px-0 lg:py-36\" data-kid=\"1-2-5\" data-name=\"ecosystem section\" id=\"owns\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1120px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"ecosystem content container\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between gap-7 lg:flex-row lg:items-end\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"ecosystem top header\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1\" data-name=\"ecosystem left header\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#7c877e]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"ecosystem eyebrow text\">\n                            The full picture\n                        </p>\n                        <h2 class=\"mt-6 font-[Lora] text-[45px] font-medium leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.055em] text-[#183b2d] sm:text-[60px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"ecosystem section headline\" id=\"ecosystem-title\">\n                            Every channel, one direction.\n                        </h2>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"max-w-[300px] text-[15px] leading-6 text-[#69756c]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2\" data-name=\"ecosystem description text\">\n                        A single intelligence keeps every surface pointed at the same outcome.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"relative mt-16 min-h-[560px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2\" data-name=\"ecosystem interactive diagram\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 z-10 h-[240px] w-[240px] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 overflow-hidden rounded-full border-[10px] border-[#f6f4ed] bg-[#c4d8bb] shadow-[0_0_0_1px_rgba(21,37,29,.18)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"central ecosystem node\">\n                        <img alt=\"Green leaf with dew by Elimende Inagella on Unsplash\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"central node leaf image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1596466933857-a0bb14f7d544?auto=format&w=760&q=80&fit=crop\"/>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute left-[2%] top-[8%] w-[230px] border border-[#15251d]/15 bg-white/70 p-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2\" data-name=\"linkedin stats card\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.17em] text-[#7c877e]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"linkedin card title\">\n                            LinkedIn\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-8 font-[Lora] text-[29px] text-[#183b2d]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"linkedin card value\">\n                            +38%\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#69756c]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"linkedin card description\">\n                            qualified traffic\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute right-[1%] top-[5%] w-[210px] border border-[#15251d]/15 bg-white/70 p-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3\" data-name=\"ai search stats card\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.17em] text-[#7c877e]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"ai search card title\">\n                            AI Search\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-8 font-[Lora] text-[29px] text-[#183b2d]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"ai search card value\">\n                            +2.4x\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#69756c]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-3\" data-name=\"ai search card description\">\n                            search mentions\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-[8%] left-[12%] w-[205px] border border-[#15251d]/15 bg-white/70 p-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-4\" data-name=\"newsletter stats card\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.17em] text-[#7c877e]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"newsletter card title\">\n                            Newsletter\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-8 font-[Lora] text-[29px] text-[#183b2d]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"newsletter card value\">\n                            41.8%\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#69756c]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-4-3\" data-name=\"newsletter card description\">\n                            average open rate\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-[5%] right-[10%] w-[185px] border border-[#15251d]/15 bg-white/70 p-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-5\" data-name=\"x stats card\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.17em] text-[#7c877e]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"x card title\">\n                            X\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-8 font-[Lora] text-[29px] text-[#183b2d]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-5-2\" data-name=\"x card value\">\n                            +71%\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#69756c]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-5-3\" data-name=\"x card description\">\n                            qualified reach\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-6\" data-name=\"ecosystem connection lines\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 1120 560\">\n                        <path d=\"M235 135 C390 170 425 198 452 238 M880 128 C760 172 712 202 668 240 M300 470 C410 416 438 374 465 330 M835 475 C742 423 699 378 659 333\" opacity=\".75\" stroke=\"#829b82\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 7\" stroke-width=\"1.2\">\n                        </path>\n                    </svg>\n                    <span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-[7%] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-[#b8d7bd] px-4 py-2 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#183b2d]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-7\" data-name=\"compounding badge\">\n                        compounding\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"proof-title\" class=\"border-t border-[#15251d]/10 bg-[#f6f4ed] px-7 pb-28 lg:px-0 lg:pb-36\" data-kid=\"1-2-6\" data-name=\"proof section\" id=\"proof\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1120px] border-y border-[#15251d]/15 py-10\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1\" data-name=\"proof metrics wrapper\">\n                <h2 class=\"sr-only\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1\" data-name=\"proof section sr-only heading\" id=\"proof-title\">\n                    Growth proof\n                </h2>\n                <div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2\" data-name=\"proof grid\">\n                    <div class=\"lg:border-r lg:border-[#15251d]/15 lg:pr-12\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1\" data-name=\"inbound conversations stat\">\n                        <p class=\"font-[Lora] text-[39px] leading-none tracking-[-0.05em] text-[#183b2d]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"inbound conversations value\">\n                            14K\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#69756c]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"inbound conversations label\">\n                            inbound conversations\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"lg:border-r lg:border-[#15251d]/15 lg:px-12\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2\" data-name=\"traffic growth stat\">\n                        <p class=\"font-[Lora] text-[39px] leading-none tracking-[-0.05em] text-[#183b2d]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"traffic growth value\">\n                            2.4x\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#69756c]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"traffic growth label\">\n                            more qualified traffic\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-8 lg:pl-12\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-3\" data-name=\"intelligence stat\">\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"intelligence value container\">\n                            <p class=\"font-[Lora] text-[39px] leading-none tracking-[-0.05em] text-[#183b2d]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"intelligence stat value\">\n                                1\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-3 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#69756c]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"intelligence stat label\">\n                                intelligence across growth\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-16 w-28\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"growth trend icon\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 112 64\">\n                            <path d=\"M2 55 C19 52 21 43 32 46 C42 49 44 36 55 39 C65 42 67 24 78 28 C88 31 94 17 110 7\" stroke=\"#2d6e51\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            </path>\n                            <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"7\" fill=\"#d7836e\" r=\"3.5\">\n                            </circle>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"cta-title\" class=\"bg-[#183b2d] px-7 py-24 text-[#f6f4ed] lg:px-0 lg:py-32\" data-kid=\"1-2-7\" data-name=\"call-to-action section\" id=\"contact\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[1120px] flex-col items-center text-center\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1\" data-name=\"call-to-action content wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"relative mb-7 h-12 w-44 overflow-hidden border-b border-[#d6c58f]/60\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1\" data-name=\"cta decorative icon wrapper\">\n                    <span class=\"absolute bottom-[-28px] left-1/2 h-24 w-24 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-[#e2c477]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-1\" data-name=\"cta decorative orb\">\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"absolute bottom-1 left-1/2 h-1.5 w-16 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-[#b6cfb5]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-2\" data-name=\"cta decorative line\">\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#b8cfbc]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2\" data-name=\"cta eyebrow text\">\n                    A calmer way to grow\n                </p>\n                <h2 class=\"mt-6 max-w-[780px] font-[Lora] text-[46px] font-medium leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.055em] sm:text-[68px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-3\" data-name=\"cta headline text\" id=\"cta-title\">\n                    Hire the intelligence behind your growth.\n                </h2>\n                <a class=\"mt-10 rounded-full bg-[#f6f4ed] px-7 py-4 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#183b2d] hover:bg-[#e8e5d8]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-4\" data-name=\"primary talk to collision button\" href=\"#top\">\n                    Talk to Collision\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"bg-[#183b2d] px-7 pb-9 text-[#b8cfbc] lg:px-0\" data-kid=\"1-3\" data-name=\"footer container\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[1120px] flex-col justify-between gap-6 border-t border-[#c9ddc7]/20 pt-7 text-[11px] sm:flex-row sm:items-center\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\" data-name=\"footer content wrapper\">\n            <a class=\"font-[Lora] text-[22px] tracking-[-0.05em] text-[#f6f4ed]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand link\" href=\"#top\">\n                collision.\n            </a>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-7 gap-y-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"footer navigation links\">\n                <a class=\"hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"footer approach link\" href=\"#approach\">\n                    Approach\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"footer what we own link\" href=\"#owns\">\n                    What we own\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3\" data-name=\"footer proof link\" href=\"#proof\">\n                    Proof\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-4\" data-name=\"footer contact link\" href=\"mailto:hi@usecollision.com\">\n                    Contact\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-3\" data-name=\"copyright text\">\n                © 2026 Collision Labs\n            </span>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n</div>\n",
