         your growth, but lighter\n                </div>\n                <h1 class=\"collision-display mx-auto max-w-[840px] text-[clamp(3.8rem,8vw,7.3rem)] font-semibold leading-[.86] tracking-[-.075em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-9-2\" data-name=\"hero title\" id=\"hero-title\">\n                    Hire your\n                    <em class=\"text-[#1f5eff]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-9-2-1\" data-name=\"hero title highlighted text\">\n                        AI Growth Executive.\n                    </em>\n                </h1>\n                <p class=\"mx-auto mt-6 max-w-[660px] text-base font-medium leading-[1.35] text-[#111111]/75 sm:text-lg\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-9-3\" data-name=\"hero description text\">\n                    Collision owns the work behind your growth — LinkedIn, X, SEO, AI search, newsletters, outbound, and every channel that helps the right people find you.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"relative mx-auto mt-9 max-w-[760px] text-left\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-9-4\" data-name=\"prompt input area\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute -right-2 -top-7 z-30 hidden rotate-[8deg] items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#00e5c0] px-3 py-2 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.12em] collision-shadow-sm sm:flex\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-9-4-1\" data-name=\"prompt badge\">\n                        <span class=\"text-base\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-9-4-1-1\" data-name=\"check mark icon\">\n                            ✓\n                        </span>\n                        always-on, approval-based\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"relative rounded-[2rem] border-2 border-[#111111] bg-white p-3 collision-shadow sm:p-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-9-4-2\" data-name=\"input box\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-9-4-2-1\" data-name=\"input box content\">\n                            <span class=\"flex-1 px-3 text-base text-[#111111]/45 sm:text-lg\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-9-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"placeholder text\">\n                                What should we grow today?\n                            </span>\n                            <button class=\"rounded-[1.25rem] border-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#1f5eff] px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-white collision-shadow-sm hover:bg-[#111111]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-9-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"run growth button\">\n                                Run growth\n                                <span class=\"ml-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-9-4-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"arrow icon\">\n                                    ↗\n                                </span>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2 border-t border-[#111111]/10 px-1 pt-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-9-4-2-2\" data-name=\"suggested prompts container\">\n                            <button class=\"rounded-full border border-[#111111]/20 bg-[#f9f9f6] px-3 py-2 text-xs text-[#111111]/65 hover:border-[#1f5eff] hover:text-[#1f5eff]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-9-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"suggested prompt button\">\n                                Launch our product\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"rounded-full border border-[#111111]/20 bg-[#f9f9f6] px-3 py-2 text-xs text-[#111111]/65 hover:border-[#1f5eff] hover:text-[#1f5eff]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-9-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"suggested prompt button\">\n                                Grow our LinkedIn\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"rounded-full border border-[#111111]/20 bg-[#f9f9f6] px-3 py-2 text-xs text-[#111111]/65 hover:border-[#1f5eff] hover:text-[#1f5eff]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-9-4-2-2-3\" data-name=\"suggested prompt button\">\n                                Optimize us for ChatGPT\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <img alt=\"Collision helmet mascot\" class=\"sticker-bob absolute -bottom-11 -left-9 z-20 size-20 rounded-full border-2 border-[#111111] bg-white object-cover p-2 collision-shadow-sm sm:-left-12\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-9-4-3\" data-name=\"mascot sticker\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/frontend-new/public/collision-helmet.png\"/>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-4 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#111111]/60\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-9-5\" data-name=\"hero trust markers container\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-1-9-5-1\" data-name=\"trust marker text\">\n                        One conversation\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"size-1 rounded-full bg-[#111111]/50\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-9-5-2\" data-name=\"trust marker divider\">\n                    </span>\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-1-9-5-3\" data-name=\"trust marker text\">\n                        One memory\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"size-1 rounded-full bg-[#111111]/50\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-9-5-4\" data-name=\"trust marker divider\">\n                    </span>\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-1-9-5-5\" data-name=\"trust marker text\">\n                        One source of truth\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-label=\"Growth channels\" class=\"overflow-hidden border-b-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#f9f9f6] py-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2\" data-name=\"growth channels ticker section\">\n            <div class=\"ticker-move flex w-max items-center gap-8 whitespace-nowrap px-4 text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.17em] text-[#111111]/70\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"ticker content\">\n                <span data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"channel item\">\n                    LinkedIn\n                    <i class=\"ml-3 inline-block size-2 rounded-