speech bubble text\">\n                        hi, I'm Collision\n                        <span class=\"text-2xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"arrow icon\">\n                            ↘\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"relative mx-auto flex aspect-square items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#ffe16a] collision-shadow-lg sm:p-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"mascot container\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-5 rounded-full border border-[#111111]/15\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"inner ring\">\n                        </div>\n                        <img alt=\"Smiling sun illustration\" class=\"relative z-10 size-[52%]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"mascot image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/openmoji-named-svgs@latest/color/sun-with-face.svg\"/>\n                        <span class=\"absolute -bottom-2 right-4 rotate-[6deg] rounded-xl border-2 border-[#111111] bg-white px-3 py-2 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.12em] collision-shadow-sm\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"label badge\">\n                            growth pal\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"personality text content\">\n                    <div class=\"mb-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.17em] text-[#1f5eff]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"sub-headline\">\n                        <span class=\"h-0.5 w-9 bg-[#1f5eff]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"sub-headline divider\">\n                        </span>\n                        the teammate part\n                    </div>\n                    <h2 class=\"collision-display max-w-[680px] text-5xl font-semibold leading-[.92] tracking-[-.06em] sm:text-7xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"main headline\" id=\"personality-title\">\n                        I know where your customers are\n                        <em class=\"text-[#ff7b63]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"main headline highlighted text\">\n                            before you do.\n                        </em>\n                    </h2>\n                    <div class=\"mt-9 space-y-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-3\" data-name=\"chat conversation container\">\n                        <div class=\"max-w-[480px] rotate-[-1deg] rounded-[1.8rem] rounded-bl-md border-2 border-[#111111] bg-white p-5 collision-shadow-sm sm:p-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"user chat bubble\">\n                            <div class=\"mb-3 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#111111]/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"speaker name\">\n                                You\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"collision-display text-2xl leading-none tracking-[-.035em] sm:text-3xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"message text\">\n                                “Can you help us get more of the right people paying attention?”\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"ml-auto max-w-[500px] rotate-[1.5deg] rounded-[1.8rem] rounded-br-md border-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#1f5eff] p-5 text-white collision-shadow-sm sm:p-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"collision chat bubble\">\n                            <div class=\"mb-3 text-right text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/60\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"speaker name\">\n                                Collision\n                                <span class=\"ml-2 inline-block size-5 rounded-full border border-white/50 bg-white/20 align-middle\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"status dot\">\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"collision-display text-2xl leading-none tracking-[-.035em] sm:text-3xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"message text\">\n                                “Already on it. I found three conversations worth starting today.”\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"mt-8 max-w-[530px] text-base leading-[1.45] text-[#111111]/60\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4\" data-name=\"description text\">\n                        No prompt gymnastics. No dashboard hopping. Tell Collision what matters and it decides what needs to happen next.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"pipeline-title\" class=\"paper-dots bg-[#f3f1e8] px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 sm:py-32\" data-kid=\"1-2-4\" data-name=\"pipeline section\" id=\"how\" style=\"background-image:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(17,17,17,.13) 1.2px,transparent 1.2px);background-size:16px 16px\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1080px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"pipeline content container\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-[620px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"pipeline headline container\">\n                    <div class=\"mb-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.17em] text-[#1f5eff]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"sub-headline\">\n                        <span class=\"h-0.5 w-9 bg-[#1f5eff]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"sub-headline divider\">\n                        </span>\n                        objective → outcome\n                    </div>\n                    <h2 class=\"collision-display text-5xl font-semibold leading-[.92] tracking-[-.06em] sm:text-7xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"main headline\" id=\"pipeline-title\">\n                        One request.\n                        <em class=\"text-[#1f5eff]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"main headline highlighted text\">\n                            Whole growth engine.\n                        </em>\n                    </h2>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-16 grid items-center gap-5 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr_auto_1fr]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"steps grid\">\n                    <div class=\"rotate-[-2deg] rounded-[1.5rem] border-2 border-[#111111] bg-white p-6 collision-shadow\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"first step card\">\n                        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#ff7b63]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"step label\">\n                            01 / objective\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-5 collision-display text-3xl leading-none tracking-[-.045em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"step title\">\n                            Launch our product\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-[#111111]/55\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"step description\">\n                            A clear goal, in plain English.\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden text-4xl text-[#1f5eff] lg:block\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"step connector\">\n                        ↝\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"rotate-[1deg] rounded-[1.5rem] border-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#a5f3fc] p-6 collision-shadow\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3\" data-name=\"second step card\">\n                        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#1f5eff]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"step label\">\n                            02 / execution\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-5 collision-display text-3xl leading-none tracking-[-.045em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"step title\">\n                            Research, drafts, distribution\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-[#111111]/65\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-3\" data-name=\"step description\">\n                            The right work, coordinated behind the scenes.\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden text-4xl text-[#1f5eff] lg:block\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-4\" data-name=\"step connector\">\n                        ↝\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"rotate-[-1deg] rounded-[1.5rem] border-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#00e5c0] p-6 collision-shadow\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-5\" data-name=\"third step card\">\n                        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#111111]/65\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"step label\">\n                            03 / outcome\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-5 collision-display text-3xl leading-none tracking-[-.045em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-5-2\" data-name=\"step title\">\n                            More of the right people\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-[#111111]/70\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-5-3\" data-name=\"step description\">\n                            Momentum you can actually feel.\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"mt-10 text-center text-base italic text-[#111111]/60\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-3\" data-name=\"footnote text\">\n                    You ask for the outcome. Collision figures out the work.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"proof-title\" class=\"bg-[#1f5eff] px-5 py-24 text-white sm:px-8 sm:py-32\" data-kid=\"1-2-5\" data-name=\"proof section\" id=\"owns\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1080px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"proof content container\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between gap-7 sm:flex-row sm:items-end\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"proof header container\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1\" data-name=\"sub-headline\">\n                        <div class=\"mb-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.17em] text-[#ffe16a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"sub-headline divider\">\n                            <span class=\"h-0.5 w-9 bg-[#ffe16a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1-1-1\">\n                            </span>\n                            cross-channel proof\n                        </div>\n                        <h2 class=\"collision-display max-w-[650px] text-5xl font-semibold leading-[.9] tracking-[-.06em] sm:text-7xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"main headline\" id=\"proof-title\">\n                            Your growth,\n                            <em class=\"text-[#ffe16a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"main headline highlighted text\">\n                                moving together.\n                            </em>\n                        </h2>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"rotate-[3deg] rounded-xl border-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#00e5c0] px-4 py-3 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#111111] collision-shadow-sm\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2\" data-name=\"badge\">\n                        compounding ↗\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-16 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_.8fr_.8fr] lg:grid-rows-[1fr_1fr]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2\" data-name=\"metrics grid\">\n                    <div class=\"relative row-span-2 overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#f9f9f6] p-7 text-[#111111] collision-shadow sm:p-9\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"main metric card\">\n                        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#1f5eff]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"metric card label\">\n                            signal, not noise\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-14 collision-display text-[clamp(4rem,8vw,7rem)] leading-[.8] tracking-[-.075em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"metric headline\">\n                            300M\n                            <span class=\"text-[#ff7b63]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"metric highlight\">\n                                +\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"mt-5 max-w-[230px] text-lg font-medium leading-tight\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"metric description\">\n                            impressions created across the channels that matter.\n                        </p>\n                        <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute bottom-7 left-7 right-7 flex h-20 items-end gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"chart container\">\n                            <span class=\"h-[25%] w-2 rounded-full bg-[#a5f3fc]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"chart bar\">\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"h-[32%] w-2 rounded-full bg-[#a5f3fc]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"chart bar\">\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"h-[44%] w-2 rounded-full bg-[#a5f3fc]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-4-3\" data-name=\"chart bar\">\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"h-[38%] w-2 rounded-full bg-[#a5f3fc]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-4-4\" data-name=\"chart bar\">\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"h-[58%] w-2 rounded-full bg-[#1f5eff]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-4-5\" data-name=\"chart bar\">\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"h-[64%] w-2 rounded-full bg-[#1f5eff]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-4-6\" data-name=\"chart bar\">\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"h-[79%] w-2 rounded-full bg-[#00e5c0]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-4-7\" data-name=\"chart bar\">\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"h-[100%] w-2 rounded-full bg-[#ff7b63]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-4-8\" data-name=\"chart bar\">\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"rotate-[1deg] rounded-[1.5rem] border-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#ffe16a] p-6 text-[#111111] collision-shadow-sm\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2\" data-name=\"metric card\">\n                        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.16em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"metric card label\">\n                            inbound\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-6 collision-display text-5xl leading-none tracking-[-.06em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"metric headline\">\n                            14K\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"metric description\">\n                            new conversations started\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"rotate-[-2deg] rounded-[1.5rem] border-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#ff7b63] p-6 text-[#111111] collision-shadow-sm\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3\" data-name=\"metric card\">\n                        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.16em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"metric card label\">\n                            AI Search\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-6 collision-display text-4xl leading-none tracking-[-.06em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"metric headline\">\n                            +38%\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-3\" data-name=\"metric description\">\n                            qualified discovery\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"rotate-[2deg] rounded-[1.5rem] border-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#00e5c0] p-6 text-[#111111] collision-shadow-sm\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-4\" data-name=\"metric card\">\n                        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.16em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"metric card label\">\n                            Newsletter\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-6 collision-display text-4xl leading-none tracking-[-.06em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"metric headline\">\n                            2.4x\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-4-3\" data-name=\"metric description\">\n                            more replies, week over week\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"rotate-[-1deg] rounded-[1.5rem] border-2 border-[#111111] bg-white p-6 text-[#111111] collision-shadow-sm\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-5\" data-name=\"metric card\">\n                        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.16em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"metric card label\">\n                            LinkedIn\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-6 collision-display text-4xl leading-none tracking-[-.06em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-5-2\" data-name=\"metric headline\">\n                            ↑ 61%\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-5-3\" data-name=\"metric description\">\n                            more qualified reach\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"cta-title\" class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[#f9f9f6] px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 sm:py-32\" data-kid=\"1-2-6\" data-name=\"cta section\" id=\"contact\">\n            <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute right-[10%] top-16 rotate-[12deg] text-4xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1\" data-name=\"lightning bolt decoration\">\n                ⌁\n            </div>\n            <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute left-[8%] top-24 rotate-[-12deg] text-2xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-2\" data-name=\"arrow decoration\">\n                ↗\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[900px] text-center\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-3\" data-name=\"cta content container\">\n                <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sticker-bob mx-auto mb-8 flex size-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#ffe16a] text-4xl collision-shadow-sm\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-3-1\" data-name=\"mascot sun decoration\">\n                    ☀\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mb-5 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#1f5eff]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-3-2\" data-name=\"badge text\">\n                    ready when you are\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"collision-display text-6xl font-semibold leading-[.86] tracking-[-.07em] sm:text-8xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-3-3\" data-name=\"cta headline\" id=\"cta-title\">\n                    Give growth\n                    <em class=\"text-[#1f5eff]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-3-3-1\" data-name=\"cta headline highlighted text\">\n                        someone to own.\n                    </em>\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"mx-auto mt-7 max-w-[510px] text-lg leading-[1.35] text-[#111111]/60\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-3-4\" data-name=\"cta description\">\n                    You keep building the company. Collision keeps the internet warm.\n                </p>\n                <a class=\"mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-[1.2rem] border-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#1f5eff] px-6 py-4 text-sm font-black text-white collision-shadow hover:bg-[#111111]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-3-5\" data-name=\"cta button\" href=\"#top\">\n                    Hire Collision\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-6-3-5-1\" data-name=\"arrow icon\">\n                        ↗\n                    </span>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"border-t-2 border-[#111111] bg-white px-5 py-8 sm:px-8\" data-kid=\"1-3\" data-name=\"footer section\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[1080px] flex-col justify-between gap-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\" data-name=\"footer content container\">\n            <a class=\"collision-display text-3xl font-black tracking-[-.06em]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"footer logo text\" href=\"#top\">\n                collision.\n            </a>\n            <nav class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#111111]/65\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"footer links container\">\n                <a class=\"hover:text-[#1f5eff]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"footer link\" href=\"#how\">\n                    How it works\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"hover:text-[#1f5eff]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"footer link\" href=\"#owns\">\n                    What it owns\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"hover:text-[#1f5eff]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3\" data-name=\"footer contact link\" href=\"mailto:hi@usecollision.com\">\n                    Contact\n                </a>\n            </nav>\n            <span class=\"text-xs text-[#111111]/45\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3\" data-name=\"copyright notice text\">\n                © 2026 Collision Labs\n            </span>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n</div>\n",
